# Boiled eggs (bread machine, ~1 L water). Lines starting with # are comments
# for humans; strip them before sending (PROGRAM ADD one line at a time).
DISCONNECT STOP
CEILING chamber 120
CEILING food 100
HOLD food 100
WAIT_GE food 90 1800
EMIT boiling
WAIT 720
HOLD_OFF
SET heater 0
SET fan 1
WAIT 300
SET fan 0
EMIT ready
HALT
